relative flex"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-2xs shrink-0 text-text/60 opacity-0 group-focus-visible/activity-header:opacity-100 group-focus-visible/activity-header:text-default group-has-[:focus-visible]/activity-header:opacity-100 group-has-[:focus-visible]/activity-header:text-default transition-transform duration-relaxed [@media(hover:hover)]:group-[:hover:not(:has([data-agent-activity-file-link]:hover))]/activity-header:opacity-100"><path d="M7.52925 3.7793C7.75652 3.55203 8.10803 3.52383 8.36616 3.69434L8.47065 3.7793L14.2207 9.5293C14.4804 9.789 14.4804 10.211 14.2207 10.4707L8.47065 16.2207C8.21095 16.4804 7.78895 16.4804 7.52925 16.2207C7.26955 15.961 7.26955 15.539 7.52925 15.2793L12.8085 10L7.52925 4.7207L7.44429 4.61621C7.27378 4.35808 7.30198 4.00657 7.52925 3.7793Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></div></div></div></div><div class="block-BQZwFn"><div data-content-search-unit-key="fallback-turn-95:2:assistant" data-chatgpt-search-unit-key="fallback-turn-95:2:assistant" data-chatgpt-search-message-ids="d4855565-ee7f-4055-a34e-03f74ce5291b d4855565-ee7f-4055-a34e-03f74ce5291b"><h4 class="sr-only m-0 select-none" data-conversation-role="assistant" tabindex="-1">ChatGPT zei:</h4><div class="group flex min-w-0 flex-col" data-chatgpt-selection-conversation-id="6ab779d5-6808-83eb-801a-2df12fe9f412" data-chatgpt-selection-message-id="d4855565-ee7f-4055-a34e-03f74ce5291b"><div data-selected-text-overlay-target="_r_1hk_" dir="auto" data-markdown-text-style="assistant-message" class="MarkdownRoot-rZKhxa [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;ol:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;ul:first-child]:mt-0" style="--markdown-link-color: currentColor;"><div class="my-4 first:mt-0 last:mb-0 empty:hidden"><div><div hidden=""></div><div class="relative PortalBoundary-TFj9W2 Renderer-ojZscX" data-theme="light" style="--puik-portal-zoom: 1;"><div dir="auto" class="DilRenderer-tB76Jj DilResponseRoot-HfQrEh LegacyReveal-lIiswq" data-d-direction="col"><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text">Klopt, Erwin — <span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">de hoofdbanner hoort ook bij wat we hebben afgesproken.</span> Ik had die niet mogen vergeten.</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text">Dit was de afspraak:</p><ul class="List-rH8nmc" data-d-component="list" data-d-marker="bullet" data-d-marker-layout="native" style="--d-list-row-gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 0);"><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Hoofdbanner:</span> de bestaande opzet behouden: HV NOVITAS en de grote slogan links, de aankondigingsfoto rechts. De donkere zwart-grijze basis met Novitas-oranje accenten blijft.</p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Evenementenbanner:</span> de kleuren beter laten aansluiten op de hoofdbanner. Het grote bruine en rood-oranje kleurverloop eruit; antraciet/zwart als basis, met oranje als accent. De tekst <span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text" data-d-font-style="italic" data-d-inline="">Muziekbingo</span>, de muzieknoten en de informatie blijven behouden.</p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Nieuws:</span> de krachtige oranje achtergrond, met de witte nieuwskaart.</p></div></div></li><li class="Item-O8JWQe" data-d-component="list-item" data-d-marker-layout="native"><div class="Content-OKAHK6"><div class="Label-B5tj_e" data-d-list-item-content=""><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text"><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline="">Sponsors:</span> de bestaande lichte achtergrond behouden.</p></div></div></li></ul><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text">De hoofdbanner en de evenementenbanner zijn twee verschillende onderdelen. De kleuren van de evenementenbanner moeten dus in de widget zelf worden aangepast; de homepage-CSS regelt de hoofdbanner en de nieuwssectie.</p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-component="text">De CSS die ik net maakte, bevat alleen de wijziging voor Nieuws. Die is dus nog niet de complete versie met alles wat we hebben afgesproken.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-1.5 flex turn-action-controls min-h-5 min-w-0 max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-wrap items-center justify-start gap-0.5 browser:-ms-0.5 browser:mt-3 electron:-translate-x-1 extension:-translate-x-1.5 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-2 [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-ring [&amp;_button]:focus-visible:ring-offset-0 [--side-tooltip:bottom]"><div class="flex min-h-5 min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-0.5 browser:gap-0"><span data-state="closed" class="contents"><button type="button" class="no-drag cursor-interaction items-center select-none disabled:cursor-default aria-disabled:cursor-default focus:outline-hidden d